{"s":59,"v":[{"t":"Whatever is in the heavens and whatever is on the earth exalts Allāh, and He is the Exalted in Might, the Wise.","w":[["سَبَّحَ","Glorifies","sabbaḥa",""],["لِلَّهِ","[to] Allah","lillahi","",[["لِ",8],["لَّهِ",9]]],["مَا","whatever","mā",""],["فِى","(is) in","fī",""],["ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","the heavens","l-samāwāti","",[["ٱل",2],["سَّمَـٰوَٰتِ",49]]],["وَمَا","and whatever","wamā","",[["وَ",1],["مَا",12]]],["فِى","(is) in","fī",""],["ٱلْأَرْضِ","the earth","l-arḍi","ۖ",[["ٱلْ",2],["أَرْضِ",35]]],["وَهُوَ","And He","wahuwa","",[["وَ",1],["هُوَ",5]]],["ٱلْعَزِيزُ","(is) the All-Mighty","l-ʿazīzu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["عَزِيزُ",130]]],["ٱلْحَكِيمُ","the All-Wise","l-ḥakīmu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["حَكِيمُ",133]]]]},{"t":"It is He who expelled the ones who disbelieved among the People of the Scripture from their homes at the first gathering. You did not think they would leave, and they thought that their fortresses would protect them from Allāh; but [the decree of] Allāh came upon them from where they had not expected, and He cast terror into their hearts [so] they destroyed their houses by their [own] hands and the hands of the believers. So take warning, O people of vision.","w":[["هُوَ","He","huwa",""],["ٱلَّذِىٓ","(is) the One Who","alladhī",""],["أَخْرَجَ","expelled","akhraja",""],["ٱلَّذِينَ","those who","alladhīna",""],["كَفَرُوا۟","disbelieved","kafarū","",[["كَفَرُ",53],["وا۟",3]]],["مِنْ","from","min",""],["أَهْلِ","(the) People","ahli",""],["ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","(of) the Scripture","l-kitābi","",[["ٱلْ",2],["كِتَـٰبِ",63]]],["مِن","from","min",""],["دِيَـٰرِهِمْ","their homes","diyārihim","",[["دِيَـٰرِ",257],["هِمْ",3]]],["لِأَوَّلِ","at (the) first","li-awwali","",[["لِ",8],["أَوَّلِ",155]]],["ٱلْحَشْرِ","gathering","l-ḥashri","ۚ",[["ٱلْ",2],["حَشْرِ",2316]]],["مَا","Not","mā",""],["ظَنَنتُمْ","you think","ẓanantum","",[["ظَنَن",261],["تُمْ",4]]],["أَن","that","an",""],["يَخْرُجُوا۟","they would leave","yakhrujū","ۖ",[["يَخْرُجُ",232],["وا۟",3]]],["وَظَنُّوٓا۟","and they thought","waẓannū","",[["وَ",1],["ظَنُّ",261],["وٓا۟",3]]],["أَنَّهُم","that [they]","annahum","",[["أَنَّ",41],["هُم",3]]],["مَّانِعَتُهُمْ","would defend them","māniʿatuhum","",[["مَّانِعَتُ",4117],["هُمْ",3]]],["حُصُونُهُم","their fortresses","ḥuṣūnuhum","",[["حُصُونُ",3407],["هُم",3]]],["مِّنَ","against","mina",""],["ٱللَّهِ","Allah","l-lahi",""],["فَأَتَىٰهُمُ","But came to them","fa-atāhumu","",[["فَ",7],["أَتَىٰ",62],["هُمُ",3]]],["ٱللَّهُ","Allah","l-lahu",""],["مِنْ","from","min",""],["حَيْثُ","where","ḥaythu",""],["لَمْ","not","lam",""],["يَحْتَسِبُوا۟","they expected","yaḥtasibū","ۖ",[["يَحْتَسِبُ",2064],["وا۟",3]]],["وَقَذَفَ","and He cast","waqadhafa","",[["وَ",1],["قَذَفَ",918]]],["فِى","into","fī",""],["قُلُوبِهِمُ","their hearts","qulūbihimu","",[["قُلُوبِ",104],["هِمُ",3]]],["ٱلرُّعْبَ","[the] terror","l-ruʿ'ba","ۚ",[["ٱل",2],["رُّعْبَ",1338]]],["يُخْرِبُونَ","they destroyed","yukh'ribūna","",[["يُخْرِبُ",4765],["ونَ",3]]],["بُيُوتَهُم","their houses","buyūtahum","",[["بُيُوتَ",191],["هُم",3]]],["بِأَيْدِيهِمْ","with their hands","bi-aydīhim","",[["بِ",10],["أَيْدِي",116],["هِمْ",3]]],["وَأَيْدِى","and the hands","wa-aydī","",[["وَ",1],["أَيْدِى",116]]],["ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","(of) the believers","l-mu'minīna","",[["ٱلْ",2],["مُؤْمِنِينَ",70]]],["فَٱعْتَبِرُوا۟","So take a lesson","fa-iʿ'tabirū","",[["فَ",7],["ٱعْتَبِرُ",3025],["وا۟",4]]],["يَـٰٓأُو۟لِى","O those endowed","yāulī","",[["يَ",42],["ـٰٓأُو۟لِى",87]]],["ٱلْأَبْصَـٰرِ","(with) insight","l-abṣāri","",[["ٱلْ",2],["أَبْصَـٰرِ",256]]]]},{"t":"And if not that Allāh had decreed for them evacuation, He would have punished them in [this] world, and for them in the Hereafter is the punishment of the Fire.","w":[["وَلَوْلَآ","And if not","walawlā","",[["وَ",1],["لَوْلَآ",167]]],["أَن","[that]","an",""],["كَتَبَ","(had) decreed","kataba",""],["ٱللَّهُ","Allah","l-lahu",""],["عَلَيْهِمُ","for them","ʿalayhimu","",[["عَلَيْ",19],["هِمُ",3]]],["ٱلْجَلَآءَ","the exile","l-jalāa","",[["ٱلْ",2],["جَلَآءَ",3324]]],["لَعَذَّبَهُمْ","certainly He (would) have punished them","laʿadhabahum","",[["لَ",23],["عَذَّبَ",295],["هُمْ",3]]],["فِى","in","fī",""],["ٱلدُّنْيَا","the world","l-dun'yā","ۖ",[["ٱل",2],["دُّنْيَا",120]]],["وَلَهُمْ","and for them","walahum","",[["وَ",1],["لَ",8],["هُمْ",3]]],["فِى","in","fī",""],["ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","the Hereafter","l-ākhirati","",[["ٱلْ",2],["ـَٔاخِرَةِ",89]]],["عَذَابُ","(is) a punishment","ʿadhābu",""],["ٱلنَّارِ","(of) the Fire","l-nāri","",[["ٱل",2],["نَّارِ",94]]]]},{"t":"That is because they opposed Allāh and His Messenger. And whoever opposes Allāh - then indeed, Allāh is severe in penalty.","w":[["ذَٰلِكَ","That","dhālika","",[["ذَٰ",32],["لِ",0],["كَ",0]]],["بِأَنَّهُمْ","(is) because [they]","bi-annahum","",[["بِ",10],["أَنَّ",41],["هُمْ",3]]],["شَآقُّوا۟","they opposed","shāqqū","",[["شَآقُّ",1079],["وا۟",3]]],["ٱللَّهَ","Allah","l-laha",""],["وَرَسُولَهُۥ","and His Messenger","warasūlahu","ۖ",[["وَ",1],["رَسُولَ",47],["هُۥ",5]]],["وَمَن","And whoever","waman","",[["وَ",1],["مَن",25]]],["يُشَآقِّ","opposes","yushāqqi",""],["ٱللَّهَ","Allah","l-laha",""],["فَإِنَّ","then indeed","fa-inna","",[["فَ",7],["إِنَّ",15]]],["ٱللَّهَ","Allah","l-laha",""],["شَدِيدُ","(is) severe","shadīdu",""],["ٱلْعِقَابِ","(in) penalty","l-ʿiqābi","",[["ٱلْ",2],["عِقَابِ",514]]]]},{"t":"Whatever you have cut down of [their] palm trees or left standing on their trunks - it was by permission of Allāh and so He would disgrace the defiantly disobedient.","w":[["مَا","Whatever","mā",""],["قَطَعْتُم","you cut down","qaṭaʿtum","",[["قَطَعْ",738],["تُم",4]]],["مِّن","of","min",""],["لِّينَةٍ","(the) palm-trees","līnatin",""],["أَوْ","or","aw",""],["تَرَكْتُمُوهَا","you left them","taraktumūhā","",[["تَرَكْ",304],["تُمُو",4],["هَا",22]]],["قَآئِمَةً","standing","qāimatan",""],["عَلَىٰٓ","on","ʿalā",""],["أُصُولِهَا","their roots","uṣūlihā","",[["أُصُولِ",1708],["هَا",22]]],["فَبِإِذْنِ","it (was) by the permission","fabi-idh'ni","",[["فَ",7],["بِ",10],["إِذْنِ",311]]],["ٱللَّهِ","(of) Allah","l-lahi",""],["وَلِيُخْزِىَ","and that He may disgrace","waliyukh'ziya","",[["وَ",1],["لِ",8],["يُخْزِىَ",700]]],["ٱلْفَـٰسِقِينَ","the defiantly disobedient","l-fāsiqīna","",[["ٱلْ",2],["فَـٰسِقِينَ",329]]]]},{"t":"And what Allāh restored [of property] to His Messenger from them - you did not spur for it [in an expedition] any horses or camels, but Allāh gives His messengers power over whom He wills, and Allāh is over all things competent.","w":[["وَمَآ","And what","wamā","",[["وَ",1],["مَآ",12]]],["أَفَآءَ","(was) restored","afāa",""],["ٱللَّهُ","(by) Allah","l-lahu",""],["عَلَىٰ","to","ʿalā",""],["رَسُولِهِۦ","His Messenger","rasūlihi","",[["رَسُولِ",47],["هِۦ",5]]],["مِنْهُمْ","from them","min'hum","",[["مِنْ",6],["هُمْ",3]]],["فَمَآ","then not","famā","",[["فَ",7],["مَآ",12]]],["أَوْجَفْتُمْ","you made expedition","awjaftum","",[["أَوْجَفْ",2951],["تُمْ",4]]],["عَلَيْهِ","for it","ʿalayhi","",[["عَلَيْ",19],["هِ",5]]],["مِنْ","of","min",""],["خَيْلٍۢ","horses","khaylin",""],["وَلَا","and not","walā","",[["وَ",1],["لَا",13]]],["رِكَابٍۢ","camels","rikābin",""],["وَلَـٰكِنَّ","but","walākinna","",[["وَ",1],["لَـٰكِنَّ",107]]],["ٱللَّهَ","Allah","l-laha",""],["يُسَلِّطُ","gives power","yusalliṭu",""],["رُسُلَهُۥ","(to) His Messengers","rusulahu","",[["رُسُلَ",47],["هُۥ",5]]],["عَلَىٰ","over","ʿalā",""],["مَن","whom","man",""],["يَشَآءُ","He wills","yashāu","ۚ"],["وَٱللَّهُ","And Allah","wal-lahu","",[["وَ",1],["ٱللَّهُ",9]]],["عَلَىٰ","(is) on","ʿalā",""],["كُلِّ","every","kulli",""],["شَىْءٍۢ","thing","shayin",""],["قَدِيرٌۭ","All-Powerful","qadīrun",""]]},{"t":"And what Allāh restored to His Messenger from the people of the towns - it is for Allāh and for the Messenger and for [his] near relatives and orphans and the needy and the [stranded] traveler - so that it will not be a perpetual distribution among the rich from among you. And whatever the Messenger has given you - take; and what he has forbidden you - refrain from. And fear Allāh; indeed, Allāh is severe in penalty.","w":[["مَّآ","What","mā",""],["أَفَآءَ","(was) restored","afāa",""],["ٱللَّهُ","(by) Allah","l-lahu",""],["عَلَىٰ","to","ʿalā",""],["رَسُولِهِۦ","His Messenger","rasūlihi","",[["رَسُولِ",47],["هِۦ",5]]],["مِنْ","from","min",""],["أَهْلِ","(the) people","ahli",""],["ٱلْقُرَىٰ","(of) the towns","l-qurā","",[["ٱلْ",2],["قُرَىٰ",218]]],["فَلِلَّهِ","(it is) for Allah","falillahi","",[["فَ",7],["لِ",8],["لَّهِ",9]]],["وَلِلرَّسُولِ","and His Messenger","walilrrasūli","",[["وَ",1],["لِ",8],["ل",2],["رَّسُولِ",47]]],["وَلِذِى","and for those","walidhī","",[["وَ",1],["لِ",8],["ذِى",87]]],["ٱلْقُرْبَىٰ","(of) the kindred","l-qur'bā","",[["ٱلْ",2],["قُرْبَىٰ",602]]],["وَٱلْيَتَـٰمَىٰ","and the orphans","wal-yatāmā","",[["وَ",1],["ٱلْ",2],["يَتَـٰمَىٰ",463]]],["وَٱلْمَسَـٰكِينِ","and the needy","wal-masākīni","",[["وَ",1],["ٱلْ",2],["مَسَـٰكِينِ",462]]],["وَٱبْنِ","and","wa-ib'ni","",[["وَ",1],["ٱبْنِ",97]]],["ٱلسَّبِيلِ","the wayfarer","l-sabīli","",[["ٱل",2],["سَّبِيلِ",79]]],["كَىْ","that","kay",""],["لَا","not","lā",""],["يَكُونَ","it becomes","yakūna",""],["دُولَةًۢ","a (perpetual) circulation","dūlatan",""],["بَيْنَ","between","bayna",""],["ٱلْأَغْنِيَآءِ","the rich","l-aghniyāi","",[["ٱلْ",2],["أَغْنِيَآءِ",446]]],["مِنكُمْ","among you","minkum","ۚ",[["مِن",6],["كُمْ",4]]],["وَمَآ","And whatever","wamā","",[["وَ",1],["مَآ",12]]],["ءَاتَىٰكُمُ","gives you","ātākumu","",[["ءَاتَىٰ",59],["كُمُ",4]]],["ٱلرَّسُولُ","the Messenger","l-rasūlu","",[["ٱل",2],["رَّسُولُ",47]]],["فَخُذُوهُ","take it","fakhudhūhu","",[["فَ",7],["خُذُ",111],["و",4],["هُ",5]]],["وَمَا","and whatever","wamā","",[["وَ",1],["مَا",12]]],["نَهَىٰكُمْ","he forbids you","nahākum","",[["نَهَىٰ",367],["كُمْ",4]]],["عَنْهُ","from it","ʿanhu","",[["عَنْ",34],["هُ",5]]],["فَٱنتَهُوا۟","refrain","fa-intahū","ۚ",[["فَ",7],["ٱنتَهُ",590],["وا۟",4]]],["وَٱتَّقُوا۟","And fear","wa-ittaqū","",[["وَ",1],["ٱتَّقُ",83],["وا۟",4]]],["ٱللَّهَ","Allah","l-laha","ۖ"],["إِنَّ","Indeed","inna",""],["ٱللَّهَ","Allah","l-laha",""],["شَدِيدُ","(is) severe","shadīdu",""],["ٱلْعِقَابِ","(in) penalty","l-ʿiqābi","",[["ٱلْ",2],["عِقَابِ",514]]]]},{"t":"For the poor emigrants who were expelled from their homes and their properties, seeking bounty from Allāh and [His] approval and supporting [the cause of] Allāh and His Messenger, [there is also a share]. Those are the truthful.","w":[["لِلْفُقَرَآءِ","For the poor","lil'fuqarāi","",[["لِ",8],["لْ",2],["فُقَرَآءِ",735]]],["ٱلْمُهَـٰجِرِينَ","emigrants","l-muhājirīna","",[["ٱلْ",2],["مُهَـٰجِرِينَ",1107]]],["ٱلَّذِينَ","those who","alladhīna",""],["أُخْرِجُوا۟","were expelled","ukh'rijū","",[["أُخْرِجُ",131],["وا۟",3]]],["مِن","from","min",""],["دِيَـٰرِهِمْ","their homes","diyārihim","",[["دِيَـٰرِ",257],["هِمْ",3]]],["وَأَمْوَٰلِهِمْ","and their properties","wa-amwālihim","",[["وَ",1],["أَمْوَٰلِ",145],["هِمْ",3]]],["يَبْتَغُونَ","seeking","yabtaghūna","",[["يَبْتَغُ",350],["ونَ",3]]],["فَضْلًۭا","bounty","faḍlan",""],["مِّنَ","from","mina",""],["ٱللَّهِ","Allah","l-lahi",""],["وَرِضْوَٰنًۭا","and pleasure","wariḍ'wānan","",[["وَ",1],["رِضْوَٰنًۭا",680]]],["وَيَنصُرُونَ","and helping","wayanṣurūna","",[["وَ",1],["يَنصُرُ",209],["ونَ",3]]],["ٱللَّهَ","Allah","l-laha",""],["وَرَسُولَهُۥٓ","and His Messenger","warasūlahu","ۚ",[["وَ",1],["رَسُولَ",47],["هُۥٓ",5]]],["أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","Those","ulāika","",[["أُو۟لَـٰٓئِ",72],["كَ",0]]],["هُمُ","they","humu",""],["ٱلصَّـٰدِقُونَ","(are) the truthful","l-ṣādiqūna","",[["ٱل",2],["صَّـٰدِقُونَ",207]]]]},{"t":"And [also for] those who were settled in the Home [i.e.,al-Madīnah] and [adopted] the faith before them. They love those who emigrated to them and find not any want in their breasts of what they [i.e., the emigrants] were given but give [them] preference over themselves, even though they are in privation. And whoever is protected from the stinginess of his soul - it is those who will be the successful.","w":[["وَٱلَّذِينَ","And thos