itting from fear of Allāh. And these examples We present to the people that perhaps they will give thought.","w":[["لَوْ","If","law",""],["أَنزَلْنَا","We (had) sent down","anzalnā","",[["أَنزَلْ",77],["نَا",11]]],["هَـٰذَا","this","hādhā","",[["هَ",0],["ـٰذَا",69]]],["ٱلْقُرْءَانَ","Quran","l-qur'āna","",[["ٱلْ",2],["قُرْءَانَ",186]]],["عَلَىٰ","on","ʿalā",""],["جَبَلٍۢ","a mountain","jabalin",""],["لَّرَأَيْتَهُۥ","surely you (would) have seen it","lara-aytahu","",[["لَّ",23],["رَأَيْ",60],["تَ",18],["هُۥ",5]]],["خَـٰشِعًۭا","humbled","khāshiʿan",""],["مُّتَصَدِّعًۭا","breaking asunder","mutaṣaddiʿan",""],["مِّنْ","from","min",""],["خَشْيَةِ","(the) fear","khashyati",""],["ٱللَّهِ","(of) Allah","l-lahi","ۚ"],["وَتِلْكَ","And these","watil'ka","",[["وَ",1],["تِ",279],["لْ",0],["كَ",0]]],["ٱلْأَمْثَـٰلُ","examples","l-amthālu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["أَمْثَـٰلُ",142]]],["نَضْرِبُهَا","We present them","naḍribuhā","",[["نَضْرِبُ",226],["هَا",22]]],["لِلنَّاسِ","to the people","lilnnāsi","",[["لِ",8],["ل",2],["نَّاسِ",67]]],["لَعَلَّهُمْ","so that they may","laʿallahum","",[["لَعَلَّ",109],["هُمْ",3]]],["يَتَفَكَّرُونَ","give thought","yatafakkarūna","",[["يَتَفَكَّرُ",582],["ونَ",3]]]]},{"t":"He is Allāh, other than whom there is no deity, Knower of the unseen and the witnessed. He is the Entirely Merciful, the Especially Merciful.","w":[["هُوَ","He","huwa",""],["ٱللَّهُ","(is) Allah","l-lahu",""],["ٱلَّذِى","the One Who","alladhī",""],["لَآ","(there is) no","lā",""],["إِلَـٰهَ","god","ilāha",""],["إِلَّا","but","illā",""],["هُوَ","He","huwa","ۖ"],["عَـٰلِمُ","(the) All-Knower","ʿālimu",""],["ٱلْغَيْبِ","(of) the unseen","l-ghaybi","",[["ٱلْ",2],["غَيْبِ",251]]],["وَٱلشَّهَـٰدَةِ","and the witnessed","wal-shahādati","ۖ",[["وَ",1],["ٱل",2],["شَّهَـٰدَةِ",423]]],["هُوَ","He","huwa",""],["ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنُ","(is) the Most Gracious","l-raḥmānu","",[["ٱل",2],["رَّحْمَـٰنُ",216]]],["ٱلرَّحِيمُ","the Most Merciful","l-raḥīmu","",[["ٱل",2],["رَّحِيمُ",119]]]]},{"t":"He is Allāh, other 